# Generated project workspaces + packaged ZIP artifacts (BuildAgent /
# DeepCodeService) -- BUILD_WORKSPACES_ROOT defaults to sana-builds/ as
# a *sibling* of sana_backend/ and sana_app/ (see build_workspace.py),
# not nested under either, so this line only takes effect if that root
# is ever pointed inside sana_backend instead. Listed here anyway so
# it's covered the moment sana_backend becomes (or is nested inside) a
# git repo, and as documentation of the real default location.
sana-builds/
_artifacts/
